('127.315.d.18.A',3,'To become a certified teacher in Texas, a candidate generally needs:','["a bachelor''s degree and an approved educator preparation program", "a law degree", "only a high school diploma", "a nursing license"]'::jsonb,0,'Degree plus preparation is required.','original'),
