('127.315.d.18.B',3,'Texas teacher candidates complete an educator preparation program, pass exams, and then apply for certification through the:','["Texas Rangers", "Texas Department of Transportation", "Texas Education Agency", "Texas Lottery Commission"]'::jsonb,2,'TEA processes certification.','original'),
