('127.346.d.4.B',4,'Planning that considers students'' readiness, interests, and learning profiles applies principles of:','["differentiated instruction", "identical instruction", "unplanned teaching", "random instruction"]'::jsonb,0,'Differentiation tailors teaching.','original'),
('127.346.d.4.C',3,'A teacher develops a study guide and practice set for a unit on fractions. This is creating:','["a staff schedule", "curriculum-related instructional materials", "a bus plan", "a school budget"]'::jsonb,1,'Study guides support instruction.','original'),
