('127.344.d.1.D',4,'A parent describes a toddler''s biting at home. Which response best shows attentive listening by the practicum student?','["Change the subject to naptime", "Offer a solution before the parent finishes", "Tell the parent it is normal and move on", "Summarize the concern and ask what the parent has already tried"]'::jsonb,3,'Summarizing and asking questions shows real listening.','original')
